*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Brother PT-P710BT (P-touch Cube Plus), 24 mm TZe tape.
*% Open driver: pages are rasterised at 180 dpi and sent through rastertopt710bt.
*%
*% Page sizes are landscape (label length x 24 mm tape) to match Snipe-IT's
*% Tapes\Brother\TZe_24mm_* label templates, so PDFs print 1:1 without rotation.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "PTP710BT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(PT-P710BT)"
*ModelName: "Brother PT-P710BT 24mm"
*ShortNickName: "Brother PT-P710BT 24mm"
*NickName: "Brother PT-P710BT 24mm tape (open driver)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Brother;MDL:PT-P710BT;CLS:PRINTER;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/PT-P710BT/Filter/rastertopt710bt"

*% ---------------------------------------------------------------- Page size
*% The imageable area is the full page so macOS rasterises all of it; Chrome
*% doesn't honour PPD margins for HTML anyway. The filter centres the ink on the
*% 18.1 mm the print head covers, and absorbs the printer's 2 mm end feeds.
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "2834.65"
*MaxMediaHeight: "68.03"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Tape24x78mm
*PageSize Tape24x34mm/34 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_C): "<</PageSize[96.38 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tape24x45mm/45 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_E): "<</PageSize[127.56 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tape24x65mm/65 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_A/D): "<</PageSize[184.25 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tape24x73mm/73 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_B): "<</PageSize[206.93 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tape24x78mm/78 x 24 mm (Windows driver default): "<</PageSize[221.1 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tape24x100mm/100 x 24 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Tape24x78mm
*PageRegion Tape24x34mm/34 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_C): "<</PageSize[96.38 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tape24x45mm/45 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_E): "<</PageSize[127.56 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tape24x65mm/65 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_A/D): "<</PageSize[184.25 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tape24x73mm/73 x 24 mm (Snipe-IT TZe_24mm_B): "<</PageSize[206.93 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tape24x78mm/78 x 24 mm (Windows driver default): "<</PageSize[221.1 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tape24x100mm/100 x 24 mm: "<</PageSize[283.46 68.03]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Tape24x78mm
*ImageableArea Tape24x34mm: "0 0 96.38 68.03"
*ImageableArea Tape24x45mm: "0 0 127.56 68.03"
*ImageableArea Tape24x65mm: "0 0 184.25 68.03"
*ImageableArea Tape24x73mm: "0 0 206.93 68.03"
*ImageableArea Tape24x78mm: "0 0 221.1 68.03"
*ImageableArea Tape24x100mm: "0 0 283.46 68.03"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Tape24x78mm
*PaperDimension Tape24x34mm: "96.38 68.03"
*PaperDimension Tape24x45mm: "127.56 68.03"
*PaperDimension Tape24x65mm: "184.25 68.03"
*PaperDimension Tape24x73mm: "206.93 68.03"
*PaperDimension Tape24x78mm: "221.1 68.03"
*PaperDimension Tape24x100mm: "283.46 68.03"

*% Any label length from 4.4 mm to 1000 mm; tape width fixed at 24 mm.
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 12.47 2834.65
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 68.03 68.03
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% ---------------------------------------------------------------- Resolution
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 180dpi
*Resolution 180dpi/180 dpi: "<</HWResolution[180 180]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ---------------------------------------------------------------- Label options
*OpenUI *CutMode/Cutting: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CutMode
*DefaultCutMode: AutoCut
*CutMode AutoCut/Cut after each label: ""
*CutMode NoCut/Don't cut: ""
*CloseUI: *CutMode

*OpenUI *ChainPrint/Chain Printing (saves tape, last label waits for next job): Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ChainPrint
*DefaultChainPrint: False
*ChainPrint True/On: ""
*ChainPrint False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *ChainPrint

*OpenUI *Darkness/Black Threshold: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: Normal
*Darkness Light/Light (only dark greys print): ""
*Darkness Normal/Normal: ""
*Darkness Dark/Dark (light greys print too): ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*OpenUI *CentreLabel/Centre on tape: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CentreLabel
*DefaultCentreLabel: True
*CentreLabel True/On: ""
*CentreLabel False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *CentreLabel

*OpenUI *FlipLabel/Rotate 180 degrees: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *FlipLabel
*DefaultFlipLabel: False
*FlipLabel True/On: ""
*FlipLabel False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *FlipLabel

*% ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fonts
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
